          "headline": "Asian stocks slide on AI fears; Kospi down about 3% as Seoul readies support fund",
          "summary": "US stock futures held gains of about 2% overnight, but Asian markets fell on Monday. South Korea's Kospi dropped as much as 4.3% early and was about 3.2% lower near 4,714 by 7:15 AM IST, with Samsung and SK Hynix down; Taiwan and Hong Kong also fell, while Japan was shut for a holiday. Seoul says a market stabilisation fund is ready if the slide goes on, Taiwan tightened short-selling rules and Chinese exchanges eased margin rules.",
